      "writtenOn": "2023-03-28T16:17:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This currently assumes all images are the same if they\u0027re non-null and come from the same source.\n\nIn the past, we used the sameAs() function provided by the Bitmap class to compare images as fast as the framework would allow.\n\nI realize the audio_util code is _incredibly bad_ with all its comparisons of Metadata objects, which also compares images, and that that can be expensive.\n\nI would opt to make this equals() function accurate though, and solve the comparisons either in the other code by reducing how liberally we use them, or even maybe just downgrading Metadata#equals() to only look for null -\u003e something and something -\u003e null changes (with a comment of course as to why we\u0027re doing that).",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 275,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 275,
        "endChar": 20
      },
      "revId": "26d7f70eb212a2744b9b4203405b55471ab5db0c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "7f4c8bb4_7e4bbaa2",
        "filename": "android/app/src/com/android/bluetooth/audio_util/helpers/Image.java",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 281,
