        "id": 1427525
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-03-28T16:17:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Note that mSource is an int representing if the image was from a URI or a Bitmap. Hashing it doesn\u0027t make sense really. You\u0027ll get lots of collisions, as every Bitmap sourced image will be considered the same as every other Bitmap sourced image.\n\nOut of curiosity, besides best practice, where do we need an Image hash code? I\u0027m not sure we currently use Image as a key to any map.\n\nAs well, looks like you missed an import 😊",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 281,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 281,
        "endChar": 37
      },
      "revId": "26d7f70eb212a2744b9b4203405b55471ab5db0c",
